ernates"},{"path":"components/stance/severance.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"800x560","subtitle":"Confirmed with its cost, never refused. Both routes to (0, 0), with arithmetic that holds.","name":"Severance"},{"path":"components/stance/stance.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x430","subtitle":"The resting target, the coach mark, and the bloomed pad — the signature interaction","name":"Stance control"},{"path":"components/states/states.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x220","subtitle":"Empty, loading, and error — designed, not blank","name":"List states"},{"path":"components/honesty/sensitive.card.html","group":"Content states","viewport":"1240x900","subtitle":"§9 — sensitive is per field and per attachment; redaction takes the whole record and leaves its skeleton.","name":"Sensitive & removed"},{"path":"guidelines/interaction-states.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"700x200","subtitle":"Hover 8%, press 10%, focus a 2px onSurface ring, disabled 38%. Defined here, not in the source.","name":"Interaction states"},{"path":"guidelines/motion-navigation.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"760x460","subtitle":"Forward, back, and a dismissal. A transition says where a screen came from, and nothing else.","name":"Screen transitions"},{"path":"guidelines/motion.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"700x180","subtitle":"M3 standard easing. Motion clarifies where something came from; it never performs.","name":"Easing & duration"},{"path":"components/proposed/media.card.html","group":"Proposed","viewport":"1000x1000","subtitle":"NOT SHIPPED — the media post, full-bleed and dominant, at true ratios with the card's full inventory around it.","name":"Post media"},{"path":"components/proposed/numbers.card.html","group":"Proposed","viewport":"760x300","subtitle":"NOT SHIPPED — the affordance every figure wears. Its explanation is a separate design.","name":"Explainable numbers"},{"path":"guidelines/shape-radii.html","group":"Shape","viewport":"